# iMBONi — Cline bootstrap (bridge file)
All real rules live in /docs. Before doing ANY work:
1. Read docs/cline/00-project-context.md
2. Read docs/cline/01-team-collaboration.md, 02-code-quality.md, 03-security-rules.md, 04-git-workflow.md
3. Identify the developer you are working for (ask if not stated): Marlene, Arcade, Gad, Cyusa or Doratha.
4. Read that developer's role file in docs/team/roles/ and docs/team/FILE_OWNERSHIP.md.
5. Run `git status` and `git branch --show-current` before modifying anything.
If a task needs files owned by someone else: STOP and request coordination (docs/team/CHANGE_PROTOCOL.md).
